('KMTC','KMTC','9','COMMON','Special provision 900 AMMONIUM HYPOCHLORITE AMMONIUM NITRATE liable to self-heating sufficient to initiate decomposition AMMONIUM NITRITES and mixtures of an inorganic nitrite with an ammonium salt CHLORIC ACID, AQUEOUS SOLUTION with more than 10% chloric acid ETHYL NITRITE pure HYDROCYANIC ACID, AQUEOUS SOLUTION (HYDROGEN CYANIDE, AQUEOUS SOLUTION) with more than 20% hydrogen cyanide HYDROGEN CHLORIDE, REFRIGERATED LIQUID (2.3(8)/2186) HYDROGEN CYANIDE SOLUTION, IN ALCOHOL w','RESTRICTED','Special provision 900 AMMONIUM HYPOCHLORITE AMMONIUM NITRATE liable to self-heating sufficient to initiate decomposition AMMONIUM NITRITES and mixtures of an inorganic nitrite with an ammonium salt CHLORIC ACID, AQUEOUS SOLUTION with more than 10% chloric acid ETHYL NITRITE pure HYDROCYANIC ACID, AQUEOUS SOLUTION (HYDROGEN CYANIDE, AQUEOUS SOLUTION) with more than 20% hydrogen cyanide HYDROGEN CHLORIDE, REFRIGERATED LIQUID (2.3(8)/2186) HYDROGEN CYANIDE SOLUTION, IN ALCOHOL with more than 45% hydrogen cyanide MERCURY OXYCYANIDE pure METHYL NITRITE (2.2/2455) PERCHLORIC ACID with more than 72% acid, by mass SILVER PICRATE, dry or wetted with less than 30% water by mass ZINC AMMONIUM NITRITE (5.1/1512) Mixtures of a hypochlorite with an ammonium salt (SP349) Ammonium bromate and its aqueous solutions and mixtures of a bromate with an ammonium salt (SP350) Ammonium chlorate and its aqueous solutions and mixtures of a chlorate with an ammonium salt (SP351) Ammonium chlorite and its aqueous solutions and mixtures of a chlorite with an ammonium salt (SP352) Ammonium permanganate and its aqueous solutions and mixtures of a permanganate with an ammonium salt (SP353)','kmtc.pdf','2026.06.15','2026-06-15',1780,true),
('KMTC','KMTC','Etc','COMMON','Carbon / Charcoal / Activated Carbon Substances ignite on exposure to air All including Non-DG are prohibited. Including all forms, grades, trade names, and synonyms of charcoal, carbonized products, Carbon black or Activated carbon, including but not limited to: Synonym of CHARCOAL, Carbonized Sawdust, Carbonized Wood powder, Carbonized Wood shaving, Carbon shell, Wooden charcoal, Bamboo charcoal, Coconut shell charcoal, Carbon briquettes and other similar carbonized or char','RESTRICTED','Carbon / Charcoal / Activated Carbon Substances ignite on exposure to air All including Non-DG are prohibited. Including all forms, grades, trade names, and synonyms of charcoal, carbonized products, Carbon black or Activated carbon, including but not limited to: Synonym of CHARCOAL, Carbonized Sawdust, Carbonized Wood powder, Carbonized Wood shaving, Carbon shell, Wooden charcoal, Bamboo charcoal, Coconut shell charcoal, Carbon briquettes and other similar carbonized or charcoal-based products.','kmtc.pdf','2026.06.15','2026-06-15',1790,true),
('KMTC','KMTC','Etc','COMMON','Lithium ion batteries All shipment is prohibited(including non-dg)','RESTRICTED','Lithium ion batteries All shipment is prohibited(including non-dg)','kmtc.pdf','2026.06.15','2026-06-15',1800,true),
('KMTC','KMTC','Etc','COMMON','Batteries Only new batteries including contained in equipment and packed with equipment are acceptable Disposal, Recycling, Damaged, Defective batteries are not acceptable','RESTRICTED','Batteries Only new batteries including contained in equipment and packed with equipment are acceptable Disposal, Recycling, Damaged, Defective batteries are not acceptable','kmtc.pdf','2026.06.15','2026-06-15',1810,true),
('KMTC','KMTC','Etc','COMMON','Reclaimed Rubber Reclaimed(Recycled) Rubber or Synonym from Malaysia is prohibited','RESTRICTED','Reclaimed Rubber Reclaimed(Recycled) Rubber or Synonym from Malaysia is prohibited','kmtc.pdf','2026.06.15','2026-06-15',1820,true),
('KMTC','KMTC','Etc','COMMON','Waste Waste except recycling purpose is prohibited Polymerizing substances and mixtures (stabilized) (SP386) - When temperature control is required, it is prohibited eventhough it will be packed in reefer container. All other purpose container such as RF, FR, OT etc except for general purpose is prohibited to load of dangerous goods - But VEHICLE is available to load on FR container and UNNO 2211, 3314 are available to load on OT container - LITHIUM ION BATTERIES VEHICLES are','RESTRICTED','Waste Waste except recycling purpose is prohibited Polymerizing substances and mixtures (stabilized) (SP386) - When temperature control is required, it is prohibited eventhough it will be packed in reefer container. All other purpose container such as RF, FR, OT etc except for general purpose is prohibited to load of dangerous goods - But VEHICLE is available to load on FR container and UNNO 2211, 3314 are available to load on OT container - LITHIUM ION BATTERIES VEHICLES are prohibited to load on FR/OT container','kmtc.pdf','2026.06.15','2026-06-15',1830,true),
('KMTC','KMTC','Etc','COMMON','All Class Prohibited TECHNICAL NAME or CHEMICAL NAME - CALCIUM HYPOCHLORITE or Synonym - AMMONIUM NITRATE or Synonym - CYANAMIDE or Synonym - DIVINYLBENZENE or Synonym - 4-SULPHONIC ACID or 4-SULFONIC ACID - SODIUM DICHLOROISOCYANURATE DIHYDRATE','RESTRICTED','All Class Prohibited TECHNICAL NAME or CHEMICAL NAME - CALCIUM HYPOCHLORITE or Synonym - AMMONIUM NITRATE or Synonym - CYANAMIDE or Synonym - DIVINYLBENZENE or Synonym - 4-SULPHONIC ACID or 4-SULFONIC ACID - SODIUM DICHLOROISOCYANURATE DIHYDRATE','kmtc.pdf','2026.06.15','2026-06-15',1840,true),
('KMTC','KMTC','3','COMMON','PSA Group 1 Classified as PSA Group 1 (For Singapore Loading / Discharge / Transshipment / In-transit) - Pre-agreement and acceptance between both parties is necessary','RESTRICTED','PSA Group 1 Classified as PSA Group 1 (For Singapore Loading / Discharge / Transshipment / In-transit) - Pre-agreement and acceptance between both parties is necessary','kmtc.pdf','2026.06.15','2026-06-15',1850,true),
('KMTC','KMTC','5.1','COMMON','Packing Group I (PG I) is prohibited. Class 5.1 from INDIA(IN)/U.A.E.(AE)/SRI LANKA(LK)/PAKISTAN(PK)/BANGLADESH(BD) is prohibited Class 5.1 to U.A.E(AE) is prohibited Class 5.1 originating or transhipping from South China (PRD Area) and Hong Kong is prohibited POL China/India is prohibited','RESTRICTED','Packing Group I (PG I) is prohibited. Class 5.1 from INDIA(IN)/U.A.E.(AE)/SRI LANKA(LK)/PAKISTAN(PK)/BANGLADESH(BD) is prohibited Class 5.1 to U.A.E(AE) is prohibited Class 5.1 originating or transhipping from South China (PRD Area) and Hong Kong is prohibited POL China/India is prohibited','kmtc.pdf','2026.06.15','2026-06-15',1860,true),
('KMTC','KMTC','8','2031','Three documents are mandatory. 1) Package certificate - The permitted use of plastic drums and jerricans as single packagings shall be two years from their date of manufacture. 2) Vanning Survey report - Prohibit wood, plywood, or fiber-based packaging(pallet, top board, side board etc). - Packages should be secured not to move in the container. - Container No. should be visibile in the stuffing photo. 3) LOI for Leak-Sensitive Liquid Cargo','RESTRICTED','Three documents are mandatory. 1) Package certificate - The permitted use of plastic drums and jerricans as single packagings shall be two years from their date of manufacture. 2) Vanning Survey report - Prohibit wood, plywood, or fiber-based packaging(pallet, top board, side board etc). - Packages should be secured not to move in the container. - Container No. should be visibile in the stuffing photo. 3) LOI for Leak-Sensitive Liquid Cargo','kmtc.pdf','2026.06.15','2026-06-15',1870,true),
