('KMTC','KMTC','9','3556','VEHICLE, LITHIUM ION BATTERY POWERED <The following regulations apply only to vehicles with lithium-ion batteries> - LITHIUM ION BATTERIES VEHICLES are prohibited to load on FR/OT container - Vehicle with used lithium ion batteries are prohibited - Lithium cell or battery test summary in accordance with sub-section 38.3 of Manual test is mandatory - MSDS for Lithium cell or battery is mandatory - On Deck Loading Only - State of Charge (SOC) LOI, SOC is mandatory 30~40% - DG C','PROHIBITED',null,'kmtc.pdf','2026.06.15','2026-06-15',2110,true),
