('KMTC','KMTC','Etc','COMMON','All Class Polymerizing substances and mixtures (stabilized) (SP386) - Letter of guarantee as follows is required: 1) Self-accelerating polymerization temperature(℃), 2) The duration of validity under chemical stabilization, and 3) The effectiveness and other properties of the stabilizer employed.','RESTRICTED','All Class Polymerizing substances and mixtures (stabilized) (SP386) - Letter of guarantee as follows is required: 1) Self-accelerating polymerization temperature(℃), 2) The duration of validity under chemical stabilization, and 3) The effectiveness and other properties of the stabilizer employed.','kmtc.pdf','2026.06.15','2026-06-15',2130,true),
('KMTC','KMTC','Etc','COMMON','Carbon-related (Non-flammable) Subject to DG Center review and confirmation: Graphite, Magnesia Carbon brick, Carbon Block, Carbon Additives, Conductive Powder, Carbon Fiber, etc., Finished goods processed from activated carbon (e.g., filters) Flammable carbon-related cargoes are prohibited.','RESTRICTED','Carbon-related (Non-flammable) Subject to DG Center review and confirmation: Graphite, Magnesia Carbon brick, Carbon Block, Carbon Additives, Conductive Powder, Carbon Fiber, etc., Finished goods processed from activated carbon (e.g., filters) Flammable carbon-related cargoes are prohibited.','kmtc.pdf','2026.06.15','2026-06-15',2140,true);
